# Mesh Town @VERSION@

Prebuilt binaries and installers of Mesh Town @VERSION@ for macOS, Windows, Linux and OpenWrt routers.

- macOS: `MeshTown-macos-<arch>-@VERSION@.zip`
- Windows: `meshtown-@VERSION@-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.zip` (with the tray icon) and the `meshtown-cli-…` archive (console only)
- Linux, OpenWrt and Keenetic: `meshtown-<version>-<target>.tar.gz` and `meshtown-cli-<version>-<target>.tar.gz`

Check a download against `SHA256SUMS` (`sha256sum -c SHA256SUMS --ignore-missing`) before running it.
